  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the excited little girl in the wheelchair, as the meme's overall intent is to inspire and uplift by showcasing her joy and empowerment. The absence of explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' means the projection is implicit, based on the user identifying with the positive emotions and empowerment conveyed by the scene. The user sees themselves in the girl's experience of joy and independence.",
